of Every Autonomous Platform"},{"t":"p","html":"Modern UAVs and autonomous systems rely on more than powerful processors—they require dependable control systems, accurate sensing, stable communication, and intelligent power management. Controllers and peripherals work together to ensure precise navigation, reliable operation, and seamless integration across complex platforms.<br><br>TechnoAI provides a complete ecosystem of flight controllers, telemetry systems, companion computers, communication modules, sensors, power distribution, and expansion peripherals to support commercial, industrial, defence, and research applications."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"BENEFITS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Key Benefits"},{"t":"ul","items":["High-performance flight control","Reliable telemetry and communication","Modular hardware ecosystem","Easy sensor integration","Open architecture compatibility","Scalable for research and industry","Mission-ready reliability","Simplified system development"],"ordered":false},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Controllers &amp; Peripheral Portfolio"},{"t":"p","html":"Our portfolio includes flight controllers, telemetry radios, GPS modules, companion computers, RC communication systems, power modules, sensors, and expansion hardware designed to support modern autonomous platforms."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"APPLICATIONS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Ideal For"},{"t":"icon","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 512 512\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><g><path d=\"M479.941 168.354c-30.338-21.085-62.985-29.802-99.791-26.642l-63.419 5.439-72.002-93.166a8 8 0 0 0-6.33-3.108h-56.767a7.998 7.998 0 0 0-7.331 11.202l40.957 93.776-100.18 8.592-41.428-48.28a8 8 0 0 0-6.071-2.79H11.008a8.003 8.003 0 0 0-7.36 11.137l39.742 93.228c6.205 14.556 18.755 24.141 34.431 26.298 33.883 4.663 67.49